{
 "unit": "xs-select-behind",
 "testfile": "T02",
 "note": "Hover feedback of Select Behind (second entry of the Pointer slot flyout). Front rectangle FR (400,200-600,300, fill #99CC99) is drawn by script over bitmap B1 of T02 (40,40-520,360). Points (document px): P1 450,250 = FR over B1, P2 570,250 = FR only, P3 200,150 = B1 only. Every hover is a mouse move without a button (canvas_move next to the point, then canvas_hover), shot of the canvas while the mouse stays; selection and active tool are read back in 'after' so the script call cannot disturb the hover state before the shot. Edges are switched on (setShowEdges(true)) after drawing FR, because the runner's view_defaults switch them off and the blue selection frame would be hidden. Mouse pointer images are not captured. Verbs as in tools/parity/runner/README.md; per_side: the reference picks the flyout entry by orig_index 1, Firepixel sets tool.selectBehind.",
 "steps": [
  {
   "id": "00_overview_normal",
   "check": "T02 + front rectangle FR 400,200-600,300 over B1 (40,40-520,360), nothing selected",
   "method": {
    "orig": "B, W",
    "fp": "B, W"
   },
   "both": [
    {
     "open_testfile": "T02"
    },
    {
     "jsf": "var d=fw.getDocumentDOM(); d.selectNone(); d.addNewRectangle({left:400,top:200,right:600,bottom:300},0); d.setFillColor('#99CC99'); d.selectNone(); d.setShowEdges(true);"
    },
    {
     "tool": "tool.pointer"
    },
    {
     "select_none": true
    },
    {
     "canvas_move": [
      700,
      550
     ]
    },
    {
     "wait": 300
    }
   ],
   "shot": {
    "area": "canvas"
   },
   "after": [
    {
     "log_value": "(function(){var s=[];for(var i=0;i<fw.selection.length;i++){var e=fw.selection[i];var r=e.pixelRect;s.push((e.name||'?')+'@'+r.left+','+r.top+'-'+r.right+','+r.bottom);}return s.length?s.join(';'):'none';})()"
    },
    {
     "log_value": "fw.activeTool"
    }
   ]
  },
